{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "760716e15a75e7ed93d0c232e73aeb36c1eba86fb1cad7a04ee06dd64b99c958", "ja": "（昨日はアイドルたちと海水浴に行ってきた。\nみんな楽しそうで、いいリフレッシュになったな！）", "zh": "（昨天和偶像们一起去海边游泳了。\n大家看起来都很开心，真是好好放松了一下啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "fae7d3d4b075ba54605373e5006246ad42b12d09ff0b0753f5170e386aa4de1c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさま～……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦啦～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "42e726ef1b02fc761ab1b59b9348f5a36dcc560f5a3175b6c521fbbbc19005f8", "ja": "響、お疲れ様……って、どうしたんだ？\nなんだか少し元気がないような……。", "zh": "响，辛苦了……等等，你怎么了？\n感觉你好像有点没精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "1bbafe674ebaf8bdfe7f5bd98a97a9383c52b82cbb6732bd2622f4a567b79e0a", "ja": "実は、日焼けのあとがヒリヒリしてて……えへへ。\nあっ！　でも本当に、ちょっとだけだぞ！", "zh": "其实是晒伤的地方火辣辣地疼……诶嘿嘿。\n啊！不过真的只有一点点疼啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1004_p", "source_sha256": "afb499082867c4824f4c2134a78c7458ffc177bb1b328feb62520b4a5e856090", "ja": "えっ！？　だ、大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "诶！？没、没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c044c52b2ba5d55160b0cca24834d921c8ba71f3761dc2cf60770ed29a8aa6a", "ja": "うん！　いつもなら、ぜんぜん平気なんだけど、\n陽射しがちょっと強かったみたい。", "zh": "嗯！平时完全没问题的，只是今天的阳光好像有点强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "ca6f7908eefdb00235d0394767c284eafef6a5dd617a417f968b83756d82e23c", "ja": "{$P$}は……あれ？\nあんまり焼けてないね？", "zh": "{$P$}……咦？\n好像没怎么晒黑呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1007_p", "source_sha256": "54a5cbc77fe2c7def4a128b21bb74ab056068dfc67bfe3da91c39dbffc5047c2", "ja": "ああ。みんなの写真を撮ったり、\n途中で仕事の電話したりで、泳がなかったからな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。因为要给大家拍照，中途还接了工作电话，所以没下水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "d2bb6032da6b14d1d73041e7c829ce9b2d27c1b0159a4d250df9c9e8b46be7d8", "ja": "た、たしかにー！　ビーチバレーは審判してたし、\nバナナボートも乗らないで、写真撮ってたよね……。", "zh": "确、确实——！沙滩排球时你在当裁判，香蕉船也没坐，一直在拍照来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "a055ba38324760f33c5ca0cf841d3b75aa1ff754dc08bef1e8e50b021c267acd", "ja": "ううっ……ごめんね、{$P$}。\n自分たちばっかり楽しんじゃって……。", "zh": "呜呜……对不起，{$P$}。  \n光顾着自己开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1010_p", "source_sha256": "626e7952cc3e2ec83545829aa1d9b0a65dd9fadec594eef8427d47f20349ae30", "ja": "気にしなくていいよ、響。\nみんなに息抜きしてもらいたくて行ったんだし。", "zh": "不用在意，响。\n本来就是想让大家放松一下才去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "04ebc3f63fe261cf87d62c4da27e2ee205517b0d0a108f74d7fb6daa75641ea5", "ja": "ダメダメ！　せっかくの海なのに見てるだけなんて、\nもったいないぞ！　……よーし、決めた！", "zh": "不行不行！难得来到海边，光看着多可惜啊！……好——决定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "3c2fa8511ff275df8350a9a8418b00e766171fb869527d87ade6d1116eebd247", "ja": "{$P$}！　もう一回、海に行こうよ！\nいーっぱい泳いで、最強の思い出つくるんだ！", "zh": "{$P$}！再去一次海边嘛！\n痛痛快快游个够，创造最棒的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e5175851824d304139438b9f212939a50d5ed0595b1c2fddbcfddc649182b5b9", "ja": "最強の思い出か。\nははっ、いいな。響と一緒なら楽しそうだな！", "zh": "最强的回忆啊。\n哈哈，听起来不错。和响一起的话，感觉会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "5bf3c2089f2bf572bbd60cdcb06333ffdf5a4f057751aa8149cd8c3377a927a9", "ja": "えへへ♪　海の遊び方なら、自分に任せて！　一日で\n{$P$}を真っ黒にしてみせるさーっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 海边怎么玩就交给我吧！一天之内，我一定能把{$P$}晒得黑黢黢的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0353_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "17a8e649da27f3aa7abf94b94f6eb2dc7b653bb59f10b36baa1d020bb7e3c9ec", "ja": "日焼けなんて気にしないくらい、\n思いっきり楽しい時間にするから、覚悟しててよね♪", "zh": "我会让这段时光快乐到让你完全顾不上晒黑，做好心理准备哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
